## 🤖 CI/CD (GitHub Actions Ready)
This project can be easily integrated into CI/CD using GitHub Actions.
A typical pipeline will:

- Install dependencies

- Install Playwright browsers

- Run tests

- Upload report artifacts

(Workflow file can be added under .github/workflows/playwright.yml.)

